# the $7Fxx register file and the bank registers, written by EZ Flash: every register the Game Boy writes, in the two write-strobe clock domains (clk_wr_a for $0000-$7FFF, clk_wr_b for $7Fxx), with the address decode after the unlock and the MBC logic that loads the bank registers in game mode
